  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improvement of the Energy Access Project in Guinea (PAAEG)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this project is to contribute to improving the living conditions of the Guinean population by (i) facilitating access to reliable and sustainable energy services for households, basic social services, and businesses; and (ii) strengthening the capacity of public actors in the electricity sub-sector (Ministry of Energy and Electricit&#xe9; de Guin&#xe9;e (EDG)). More specifically, the project in the localities covered by IsDB will (a) connect 61,862 customers to the network; and (b) help improve EDG&apos;s overall performance by reducing the overall loss rate from 35% to 15%.</narrative>
  </description>
